# The legacy merged bundle is DERIVED from thesession.json + folkwiki.json by
# assemble_datasets.py. Committing it as well would add ~42 MB of pure
# redundancy to every data revision on top of the 45 MB of dataset files.
#
# It is still deployed: firebase.json has its own ignore list and does not
# consult .gitignore, and build.sh writes the file into public/ before
# `firebase deploy`. Installed apps predating dataset selection depend on it,
# so if you ever deploy by hand, regenerate it first.
public/folkfriend-non-user-data.json
